- en.i18n.yaml: `group.first`: the links form a cycle: `group.first` → `group.second` → `group.third` → `group.first`
- en.i18n.yaml: `group.second`: the links form a cycle: `group.second` → `group.third` → `group.first` → `group.second`
- en.i18n.yaml: `group.third`: the links form a cycle: `group.third` → `group.first` → `group.second` → `group.third`
- en.i18n.yaml: `group.loop`: the links form a cycle: `group.loop` → `group.loop`
